{"id":"5e4b1627eb789652","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-game4-repeated-game.md","title":"ZFC Game4 Repeated Game","display":"df-zfc-game4-repeated-game — ZFC Game4 Repeated Game","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game4-repeated-game","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game4-repeated-game"],"display":"df-zfc-game4-repeated-game — ZFC Game4 Repeated Game","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-zfc-game4-normal-form-game]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game4-repeated-game"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game4-repeated-game</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game4-repeated-game — ZFC Game4 Repeated Game"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"22df4f3e7d0489b8\" href=\"?note=22df4f3e7d0489b8\" title=\"58-df-zfc-game4-normal-form-game\">58-df-zfc-game4-normal-form-game</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ordinal}\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ordinal}\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame4NormalFormGame}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame4NormalFormGame}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame4RepeatedGame}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame4RepeatedGame}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,T,\\mathcal G,N,\\vec S,\\vec u\\in V\">\\(G,T,\\mathcal G,N,\\vec S,\\vec u\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame4NormalFormGame}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame4NormalFormGame}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"22df4f3e7d0489b8\" href=\"?note=22df4f3e7d0489b8\" title=\"58-df-zfc-game4-normal-form-game\">58-df-zfc-game4-normal-form-game</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame4RepeatedGame}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame4RepeatedGame}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}repeated\\text{-}game}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame4RepeatedGame}_S(G,T,\\mathcal G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(T)\\land\n\\exists N,\\vec S,\\vec u\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nG=\\langle N,\\vec S,\\vec u\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame4NormalFormGame}_S(N,\\vec S,\\vec u)\\land\n\\operatorname{Function}(\\mathcal G,T,\\{G\\})\\land\n\\forall\\alpha\\in T\\;(\\mathcal G(\\alpha)=G)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}repeated\\text{-}game}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame4RepeatedGame}_S(G,T,\\mathcal G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(T)\\land\n\\exists N,\\vec S,\\vec u\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nG=\\langle N,\\vec S,\\vec u\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame4NormalFormGame}_S(N,\\vec S,\\vec u)\\land\n\\operatorname{Function}(\\mathcal G,T,\\{G\\})\\land\n\\forall\\alpha\\in T\\;(\\mathcal G(\\alpha)=G)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The stage game is an explicitly coded normal-form game and the stage family is checked by the canonical function predicate as the unique constant function on the ordinal horizon <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>; payoff aggregation remains a separate downstream choice.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-game4-normal-form-game","status":"resolved","id":"22df4f3e7d0489b8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-game4-normal-form-game]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-game4-normal-form-game","status":"resolved","id":"22df4f3e7d0489b8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcGame4NormalFormGame}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[58-df-zfc-game4-normal-form-game]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-ordinal]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}\\subsete